'''Sunflora''' (Japanese: '''キマワリ''' ''Kimawari'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

