==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Sunflora|105}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*'''Trip Over''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Asobikata|Diglett|promo}}, one of the {{TCG|Unnumbered Promotional cards}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

